<title>UK: UBS sets 200 million Swiss franc bond.</title>
<headline>UBS sets 200 million Swiss franc bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by sole lead manager UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   UNION BANK OF SWITZERLAND</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN SFR   COUPON     2.50	MATURITY    20.DEC.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  98.25     PAY DATE    20.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER    =	   EOS	   13.DEC.96</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    EBS	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES	DOMESTIC BOND WITH REOPENING CLAUSE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
